        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Since it seems we&#39;ve temporarily lost the ability to edit, gotta post this seperate.\n\nHere&#39;s a quote from Christopher from the discussion on Ambuscade that I thought people would like to see.\n\n[quote=\"Christopher\"]\n\nAs the card says, whenever a trap card is the top card of the deck, it goes off. Thus, when you reveal the top card of the deck, and the next card is the trap card, it goes off, as it becomes the top card of the deck.\n\nSo, thematically, hunting for Ambuscade sometimes results in running into his traps!\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n",
