        "created_at": "2012-09-13T07:10:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So is it the general ruling that revealed cards are, for the moment at least, not in the deck? So if Nightmist targets herself with Enlightenment and picks up a 1 Value card, she can still benefit from targeting herself with Enlightenment as opposed to a teammate? I'd been playing it that the revealed card was still the top card of the deck, so that if she targeted herself, it was one of the cards she drew (and then after drawing it she'd have to put it in the Trash).</p>",
